      "finding": "Villars and Daams (1993) is a crystallographic structure/volume compilation, not a pressure-volume experiment. Supplementary Table 2.2 preserves the rounded ambient volumes and the applied thermal and zero-point shifts; no per-element raw compression observations exist in this branch."
